  "description": "Distributed Circuit Breaker that coordinates state across multiple .NET application instances using Redis. Perfect for microservices, cloud applications, and scaled systems. When any instance detects failures and breaks the circuit, ALL instances immediately stop calling the failing service via Redis coordination. Works with Azure Redis Cache, AWS ElastiCache, Redis Cloud, and self-hosted Redis. Simple fluent API, automatic fallback, distributed locking to prevent race conditions.",
  "id": "CircuitBreaker.Redis.Distributed",
